WEBVTT

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:10.210
Mr. Nishida, you were too
true to your ideals.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:15.160
And you knew delicate structures
made up of pristine ideals

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.530
cannot house real people
for any length of time.

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:24.330
In the end, I am alone.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.250
Misuzu...

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:47.350
Destruction... Yes, true creation only
takes place in the midst of destruction.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:51.130
By assuming control over
destruction and creation,

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:55.090
I shall become a puppeteer with
history at my fingertips.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.460
And of time captive, haunted by an
ambition spanning a millennium.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:02.500
Ambitions of the past are
not what I seek.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:09.250
Then why do you seek the power
of the Gasaraki after all this?

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.180
So that I may seek to
negate everything.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.220
I intend to destroy the
order and structure

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.340
that this nation has built in the past.

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:24.460
Following that, I will be a new lord,
reigning over time.

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.060
The succession of the gods...

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.170
The clan, which was robbed
of their gods and nation,

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:31.930
is about to rob the nation
to make it their own.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.640
Rob the world as well.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:38.000
The karma of desire...

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:44.340
You represent the karma of desire
resident in all humans.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:47.020
This is wrong.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:50.850
Destruction only brings about
more suffering.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.660
The ties that bind the hearts
of people to people,

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:57.390
the heart that's willing to believe

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:59.490
is the source of all power to create.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.830
Those are the limits with
which you are stuck.

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:09.130
But I will go farther! Until I realize
ultimate destruction!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:52.820
By covering the kugai's surface with
laser panels and solenoids,

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:56.950
we can electroplate the combined
crystals on the core's surface.

00:02:56.950 --> 00:03:01.690
The core? The perfect crystal of the
kugai that Yushiro created last night?

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.730
A huge complex molecule that stores
a multitude of information

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:07.430
regarding itself in its structure...

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:09.330
By using that as the seed crystal,

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.070
we can grow new structures around it,

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:13.970
allowing us to build a perfect replica
of the original kugai.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:17.670
Brother, I was just talking this
over with Mr. Yonetani.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.410
It's going to be difficult to create
an original entity

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:22.210
in a short time span without
Yushiro here.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:25.080
Don't worry. The kai will come.

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:29.110
Yes, soon the kai will arrive.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.940
Why did Mr. Nishida...

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.070
To calm people down.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.980
Words alone aren't enough.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.880
Words have little influence over people

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.350
who have surrendered to the mob
mentality and are on a rampage.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.690
That's why...

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.690
That's why he spoke out to them
by taking his own life.

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:10.990
It is far harder to bring
closure to an affair

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:13.220
than it is to instigate one.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:17.270
This was written by Mr. Nishida
just before he passed on.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.710
Breaking up of the SSDF?

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:26.940
Yes, Mr. Nishida was ultimately
aiming for the elimination

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:31.580
of state sponsored coercion, military
forces, from this nation.

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:34.910
Japan would take the initiative
and disarm first.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:36.950
He wanted to make it clear,
by doing so,

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:39.180
that we were prepared to follow through
on the long, true contest.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:42.730
To face the test with complete
dedication and sincerity.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:44.560
The true contest?

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:48.000
To ask ourselves continuously
and without hesitation,

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.260
what we are supposed to do.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.700
We must marshal together
all of our strength

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.040
to answer this momentous question
as best we can.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.380
How about laser panels?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:03.050
Should be completed in
about thirty minutes.

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:07.080
Mr. Kiyotsugu, we're fifteen percent
short on electrical power.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.250
We'll have some of the power from the
computer room re-routed to us.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.720
Wait for a while longer.

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:20.700
There's no question your physical
abilities are extraordinary

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.490
when compared to most people.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:25.600
But unfortunately, with regards
to being a kai...

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:29.540
Not a kai? Not a kai...

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:31.980
I am not a kai.

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:35.110
He fulfills all the other physical
condition criteria,

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:36.080
but the "l" globulin count is...

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:36.750
Kai... I am not a kai?
but the "l" globulin count is...

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:40.200
Kai... I am not a kai?

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:48.990
The kai...

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:58.370
Misuzu!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.160
Kazukiyo! Kazuharu! How could you?!

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:07.140
You're not human!

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:09.310
Conducting an experiment
using Misuzu...

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.510
Big brother, what are you?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.280
Not a human being?

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.620
The Gowa way of life, our
entire way of life,

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:18.250
diverges from how human
beings live their lives.

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:23.430
And did you two not agree to
support such a way of life

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:25.830
when you raised your hands?

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:28.920
Go. Continue with the preparations.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:31.770
Let's go.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:37.440
Well, big brother...

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:42.250
I've contacted Father.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.710
He should be here any minute.

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:49.620
The quickening...

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.360
Can you hear it, Misuzu?

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:56.430
The voice of the kugai speaking
out to you?

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:57.890
The voice of the kugai?

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.230
It's the voice that's calling to you.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.760
Calling me?

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:04.490
Yes, calling out to you, the kai!

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:08.240
You possess the same powers
Yushiro possesses.

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:11.910
You are...

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.380
I am...

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.010
A kai!

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:15.310
A kai?
A kai!

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.470
A kai?

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:21.180
Redeem the memories of your powers,
the same as Yushiro's powers.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:25.140
The same as big brother Yushiro...

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.000
Begin!

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.170
Mr. Kiyotsugu...

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:49.340
We're beginning. Is that okay with you?

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.110
Please begin.

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:06.060
They wouldn't!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.160
Hey, where are you going?!

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:15.970
Rebirth... The memory of a millennium

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:19.310
is about to be restored!

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.860
Big brother!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.940
My big brother...

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:53.300
Big brother's gone.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:59.650
Alone... I'm all alone.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:04.590
Big brother?

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:44.290
Big brother, you've come back.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:47.820
The memories of the kai remain
alive within the kugai.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.200
Your real older brother who
died eight years ago,

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:52.000
is alive inside there as well.

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.270
The kugai will connect you to Yushiro.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:01.140
I am...

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:04.810
A kai!

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:32.270
There you are, Yushiro.

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:36.010
Misuzu!

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:43.420
Misuzu!

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:43.990
Stay away!
Misuzu!

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:44.880
Stay away!

00:10:48.090 --> 00:10:51.690
That's right, Misuzu. This man
is not your real brother.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:54.430
If you want to see your real brother,

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:57.560
concentrate and wring more out
of your powers as a kai!

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.050
Misuzu...

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:24.830
Is the Gasaraki really going to appear?

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:30.230
Kazukiyo!

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:35.030
I will not let you do this!

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:40.480
Father...

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:42.580
Father...

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:42.850
Misuzu...
Father...

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:43.450
Misuzu...

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.180
Misuzu...
Father...

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:44.950
Come back to me.
Father...

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:45.610
Come back to me.

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:45.680
Come back to me.
Father...

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.080
Father...

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:00.900
I won't let you go.

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:02.360
Father...

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:03.770
Father...

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:04.500
How could I let you go?
Father...

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:05.300
How could I let you go?

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:08.370
Father...

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:08.570
Misuzu!
Father...

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:09.830
Misuzu!

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.680
How could you?

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:24.590
Father!

00:12:31.530 --> 00:12:33.550
No one will get in the way!

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.970
You killed...

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:45.570
Why? Why do you keep committing
terrible acts like this?

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:53.720
Why?! You killed Father just
to satisfy your desire!

00:12:53.720 --> 00:13:00.780
Desire? You're no better than the
fool who just perished.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:04.460
How could you cruelly sacrifice others
just for your ambition?

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.500
My acts serve an eternal will,

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:10.830
a will that is unconcerned with the
mere emotions of mortals.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:13.830
Those with hearts full of ambition such
as yours cause endless pain!

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:18.370
The anger of the kai is the anger

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:22.310
of multitudes of victims who have fallen
in the last thousand years,

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:26.880
and it is the door that leads
to the eternal terror.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:31.380
Don't you realize, Yushiro?!
Your very existence...

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.190
Your very presence as kai constitutes
this world's terror!

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:53.900
Your anger, your sorrow will
invite the Gasaraki.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:03.020
The heart rate of the subject
is increasing!

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:04.490
What about brain waves?

00:14:10.690 --> 00:14:13.830
Singularity expanding! Energy levels on
the inside of the kugai are increasing.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.300
This is working!

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.940
Reading GS emissions, highest
ever recorded.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.570
All right, don't let anything pass you by.

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:40.650
Heart rate above 500!

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:53.900
Misuzu...

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:14.190
Finally...

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:19.300
Distortion of gravity field, plus forty!

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:20.790
Energy readings are so intense...

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:26.430
This is the deluge of information?

00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:35.300
Formerly a kai myself, I will
submit myself as well.

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:42.690
We've lost contact with CB-3!

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:44.520
All monitoring has shut down!

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.530
Oh firestorm of Gasaraki,

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:56.690
Heed my call. Grant me
passage into infinity!

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:23.420
I... I've been allowed in?!

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:28.130
We have been waiting.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:32.660
For a million years, we have waited,

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:35.530
patiently and single-mindedly.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.710
Waited?

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:40.140
Yes, waited.

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.100
Who? Who are you?

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.980
What you see before you.

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:48.080
What we see?

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:50.920
Yes, that is who we are.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:52.750
Why?

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:56.090
Why is it so cold here?

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:59.820
Nature, time, space...

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:03.870
We, who have existed since
this world was created,

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:07.600
all of us are alive within you.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.070
When our fantasy of desire for
the limitless was broken,

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:13.470
when we started upon the
path of self-destruction,

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:17.070
we entrusted our dreams to you.

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.610
There's no one here.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:24.410
Why was I doomed to roam
for 2,000 years?

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:28.950
What brought about your doom?

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:33.730
The arrogance that came about from
the belief that civilizations

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:36.290
could change the nature of life.

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:39.600
This was the consequence
of that arrogance.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:43.010
Because, in seeking to secure
an existence as immortals,

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:46.530
we rewrote the inordinate systems
that make up the structure of life.

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:50.680
You became obsessed with the
splendor of your civilization,

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:53.450
you lost sight of your true nature,

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:57.980
and resorted to meddling
with the source of life.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:02.060
No one...

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:05.160
You were robbed of the place
for lives to return home to.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:09.200
You found yourselves stuck
in this barren realm.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.830
That was when we came
across a new strand

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:15.130
of genetic information, one
full of vitality and life.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:18.060
And so you looked upon us
as a means of escape?

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:22.900
Our fates were rewritten by you?

00:18:23.380 --> 00:18:25.900
And that gave birth to the Gasaraki.

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:30.480
The successor, the one who
will spin our dreams.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.020
We extracted the genetic
thread from the unit

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:34.790
that possessed the greatest potential,

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:39.430
and embedded a minimum amount of
information that we would need

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:43.060
and a tracking device that would
monitor your evolution.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.500
That is what the kai is?

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:49.760
This is like a comedy.

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:51.570
What about our heart and soul?

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:55.270
Are you telling us that what we feel
is something from beyond?

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.010
The product of your dreams?

00:18:58.010 --> 00:19:00.980
All of this was a means to the end
of acquiring infinite power?

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:05.890
How many countless lives were played
with as a result of this?

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:08.320
In the end, your fate is nothing more

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:11.720
than an empty fantasy created by that
towering, tremendous malice.

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:19.460
You tell us we should inherit your will.

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:21.440
I'm alone.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:25.410
I want to go home, back
where everybody is.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:27.980
But what's important to me, more
important than any great power,

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:31.380
is to share the joys and pains that
come with our brief existence.

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:35.780
Yes! Even if we could come to
possess limitless powers,

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:37.950
we would not be led by our own will.

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:44.030
I will live out my life,
even if it is limited.

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:48.060
It has been so long...

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:50.870
I want to go home.
I want to go home.

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:52.330
Back where everybody is...

00:19:57.970 --> 00:20:00.540
I will live out my life in my own time!

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.600
I will live my own life!

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:06.320
I will live out my life as best I can!

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:07.780
Now...

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:13.020
I can...

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:18.630
I don't want to be alone.

00:20:18.630 --> 00:20:19.090
Misuzu, you are not alone!
I don't want to be alone.

00:20:19.090 --> 00:20:21.120
Misuzu, you are not alone!

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:25.220
Big brother, never forget me.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.940
Please, never forget me. That's all I ask.

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:29.640
That's all that I want.

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:30.440
We are not puppets with the strings
of fate attached to us!
That's all that I want.

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:32.540
We are not puppets with the strings
of fate attached to us!

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.540
With my own will? But there
could never be...

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:40.810
Yes there is! If you really wish hard
to be back with everyone else!

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:46.420
Come on, cast yourself free from
all those that hold you back!

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:51.860
Let's go home, to where everyone is!

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:55.230
Come back home!

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:58.730
Let's go home!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.200
Misuzu!

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:04.200
I want to go home.

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:20.290
Stop, Yushiro! Stop it right now!

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:21.850
Please stop!

00:21:22.420 --> 00:21:23.890
Go back!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:38.060
Wait! Grant me passage, Gasaraki!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:41.100
Deliver me to infinite power!

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:32.030
The wind...

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.260
We're alive...

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:43.790
Hark

00:22:45.040 --> 00:22:47.680
It's time I journey

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:55.020
Break apart my heart

00:22:55.020 --> 00:23:01.490
For crimson sadness

00:23:01.490 --> 00:23:08.860
